# Effective indices of the full and the shallow-etched slab, and the group index of their mean.
# Reference: root of the three-layer dispersion relation found with SciPy.
title 300 nm silicon slab, air cladding
stack core=0.3
materials clad=air
grating angle=10 etch=0.096
expect n_full 3.04037090 2e-07
expect n_etched 2.77177876 2e-07
expect n_grating 2.90607483 2e-07
expect group_index 3.73640334 0.0002
